abstract: >
  Interactive, self-contained reference implementation of the Risk
  Mechanism Theory Index (RMTI) for hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC)
  surveillance and public-health surveillance settings. Implements
  R = L*E*V*(1-rho) and EAL = L*C*(1-rho), a fixed five-tier scale, and
  a log-normalized exposure helper, with a worked example library and a
  Custom / Your Field mode with local export/import of saved cases. For
  educational and research use only; not a medical device.
